  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Summer Meals for Philly Kids</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For kids and families who depend on free and reduced-cost school meals, it can be challenging to provide these additional meals over the summer months - especially here in Philadelphia where kids experience food insecurity at a rate of 25.5%. That&apos;s double the national average.  At the Coalition Against Hunger we work to ensure Philly kids have access to free, healthy meals throughout the summer by operating a live Summer Meals Hotline and maintaining a Summer Meals Map for our 5-county area.</narrative>
  </description>
